      "message": "In NsdManager API, the service name is only one label.\nFor service type it can be multiple labels.\n\nIn cast use case the service type is \"_googlecast._tcp.local\" \nThe service name is \"{some random UUID}\".\n\n\"_googlecast._tcp.local\"  will be a qname in PTR query.\n\"{some random UUID}._googlecast._tcp.local\" will be a qname is SRV/TXT query.\n\nBoth will be trigger the offload reply.",
